{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/4.gif?t=1747119328\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dark Dominion - A Next-Gen Souls-Like Game by ZERO5GAMES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dark Dominion</strong> is a dark and brutal story of a World War I soldier trapped between life and death. After losing his family on the battlefield, he perishes but has yet to realize it. The soldier\u2019s soul wanders through a distorted world, desperately trying to find his daughter in the eerie darkness of the otherworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by genre classics, the game is crafted with a passion for gothic aesthetics by a single enthusiast, drawing inspiration from games like <strong>Dark Souls</strong>, <strong>Diablo II</strong>, and <strong>Demon\u2019s Souls</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/Video_25.gif?t=1747119328\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Story:</strong> The game blends a dark gothic atmosphere with elements of psychological horror, gradually revealing the bitter truth about the protagonist\u2019s fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Descent into Madness:</strong> Haunting visions and the ghost of the lost one will pursue you throughout the journey \u2014 but can you really trust her?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hardcore Combat:</strong> Fierce battles in the spirit of <strong>Dark Souls</strong> and <strong>Demon's Souls</strong> with bosses that personify the hero\u2019s fears and guilt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploration of a Mysterious World:</strong> Discover five vast locations filled with lore, puzzles, and horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Next-Gen Graphics:</strong> A gothic world designed with stunning detail and photorealism, immersing you in an atmosphere of despair and melancholy.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/1_1.gif?t=1747119328\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf11 <strong>Why You Should Play:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Not Made for Profit:</strong> The game is created out of love for the genre, not for financial gain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Unique Blend:</strong> Gothic horror meets psychedelic drama in a distinctive combination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Balanced Experience:</strong> A fine line between hardcore combat and storytelling: every battle is a trial, every step a journey into the unknown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intriguing Characters:</strong> Their tragic backstories serve as an exploration of the nature of madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Philosophical Depth:</strong> Confront your mistakes and embrace the pain.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3237640?t=1747119328","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747119328","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/683643217b35045e0337b0a9478eee1276008cbf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747119328","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/683643217b35045e0337b0a9478eee1276008cbf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747119328","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains scenes of cruelty and violence, chopping off limbs, meat, corpses, blood. The game is not recommended for particularly sensitive people."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/4.gif?t=1747119328\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dark Dominion - A Next-Gen Souls-Like Game by ZERO5GAMES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dark Dominion</strong> is a dark and brutal story of a World War I soldier trapped between life and death. After losing his family on the battlefield, he perishes but has yet to realize it. The soldier\u2019s soul wanders through a distorted world, desperately trying to find his daughter in the eerie darkness of the otherworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by genre classics, the game is crafted with a passion for gothic aesthetics by a single enthusiast, drawing inspiration from games like <strong>Dark Souls</strong>, <strong>Diablo II</strong>, and <strong>Demon\u2019s Souls</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/Video_25.gif?t=1747119328\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Story:</strong> The game blends a dark gothic atmosphere with elements of psychological horror, gradually revealing the bitter truth about the protagonist\u2019s fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Descent into Madness:</strong> Haunting visions and the ghost of the lost one will pursue you throughout the journey \u2014 but can you really trust her?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hardcore Combat:</strong> Fierce battles in the spirit of <strong>Dark Souls</strong> and <strong>Demon's Souls</strong> with bosses that personify the hero\u2019s fears and guilt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploration of a Mysterious World:</strong> Discover five vast locations filled with lore, puzzles, and horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Next-Gen Graphics:</strong> A gothic world designed with stunning detail and photorealism, immersing you in an atmosphere of despair and melancholy.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/1_1.gif?t=1747119328\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf11 <strong>Why You Should Play:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Not Made for Profit:</strong> The game is created out of love for the genre, not for financial gain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Unique Blend:</strong> Gothic horror meets psychedelic drama in a distinctive combination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Balanced Experience:</strong> A fine line between hardcore combat and storytelling: every battle is a trial, every step a journey into the unknown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intriguing Characters:</strong> Their tragic backstories serve as an exploration of the nature of madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Philosophical Depth:</strong> Confront your mistakes and embrace the pain.</p></li></ul>","developers":["ZERO5GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/0d33e99b22194f86481de1d81192af0c100fb1fc/header.jpg?t=1747119328","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257070630,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257070630/movie480.mp4?t=1733366610","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailer